// Whimsey decimal font.
//
// The original legacy glyph data was released under CC0-1.0. See
// libraries/vcs/fonts/README.md and the retained upstream LICENSE.txt.
// Glyph rows are written top-to-bottom for visual readability; the
// VCS_FONT_GLYPH alias reverses each glyph for the score kernel.

alias VCS_FONT_GLYPH(a,b,c,d,e,f,g,h) h,g,f,e,d,c,b,a

